OL,3,GNEWSANurse comforting bereaved family
OL,4,Agets parking fine
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nurse who was given a #100 parking
OL,7,Ffine while comforting a bereaved family
OL,8,Fhas called for greater protections
OL,9,Fagainst fines for fellow nurses.
OL,11,FVaranica Whinfield, a community nurse
OL,12,Ffrom Oldbury, was giving care while
OL,13,Fparked at Perry Barr Village, the same
OL,14,Flocation where fellow nurse Lisa Smith
OL,15,Fwas recently fined after getting stuck
OL,16,Fin a lift while trying to treat a sick
OL,17,Fbaby.
OL,19,F"I'm providing care [at] the last
OL,20,Fminute, which is like life and death,"
OL,21,FWhinfield told BBC Radio WM.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
